1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,200
GradeStream
Your Resolve grade on the client's phone. Just a link.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:08,500
How it works: monitor → GradeStream → link → phone

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,200
The client installs nothing

4
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,000
Notes right on the frame: the client taps and writes

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,700
The marker reaches you, with a snapshot of that frame

6
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:24,200
Scopes on the client's phone:
Waveform, Parade, Vectorscope

7
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,700
Out of range — the scope frame flashes red

8
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:32,700
Vertical video — 1080×1920

9
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:39,200
Color arrives as a signal: average ΔE2000 0.22
(visibility threshold ≈ 1.0)

10
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:44,200
GradeStream — free, open source
github.com/ushtozhish/gradestream

